    <item>
      <title>MyNewFile 1.3.0</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 03:26:08 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.3.0</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<p>New File can ask for the name before creating the file, and scripts (.sh, .py) are created ready to run. Copying, pasting and moving no longer freeze the Finder with large files. Paste also appears when you right-click files or folders, shows where the files come from, and lets you cancel a cut. New Move To for favorite folders. Images: convert to HEIC, adjustable quality and maximum size, an option to move the originals to the Trash, and iPhone photos no longer come out rotated. Errors are now always reported.</p>]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/fernandorm/mac-app-updates/releases/download/mynewfile-v1.3.0/MyNewFile-1.3.0.zip" length="1880871" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="IWqiXzcwjXMm1jPTzM/6s618DzSlB80VBFU3xatz2U+CVQ6U2AYjOFof+obQB+NV0AV/8yzyA5t+13iIno6kBg=="/>
    </item>
